WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.001 --> 00:00:07.852
While Hope was at school, Robot waited.

2
00:00:07.853 --> 00:00:10.572
He kept thinking about show-and-tell.

3
00:00:10.573 --> 00:00:15.034
"I want things to go well for Hope," he thought.

4
00:00:15.035 --> 00:00:18.884
"But why didn't she choose me

5
00:00:18.885 --> 00:00:23.685
?" Robot paced

6
00:00:23.686 --> 00:00:26.384
around. Finally he heard the door

7
00:00:26.385 --> 00:00:31.423
open. Hope burst into the room,

8
00:00:31.424 --> 00:00:34.449
smiling. Hope looked at Robot and

9
00:00:34.450 --> 00:00:37.141
grinned. "Show-and-tell was great,

10
00:00:37.142 --> 00:00:40.109
Robot! Someone in my class really likes MechaTron

11
00:00:40.110 --> 00:00:43.638
too. She even brought the same

12
00:00:43.639 --> 00:00:45.881
comic!" Hope flopped onto her

13
00:00:45.882 --> 00:00:48.107
bed. "I don't know if you understand

14
00:00:48.108 --> 00:00:50.958
me. But thanks for

15
00:00:50.959 --> 00:00:54.501
listening." Robot liked hearing

16
00:00:54.502 --> 00:00:57.477
that. "Hey, I have an idea," Hope

17
00:00:57.478 --> 00:01:02.592
said. She picked Robot

18
00:01:02.593 --> 00:01:05.335
up. She set him behind the

19
00:01:05.336 --> 00:01:08.777
door. "Let's play

20
00:01:08.778 --> 00:01:16.194
spies!" Hope sneaked around the

21
00:01:16.195 --> 00:01:20.002
room. She tapped her hearing aid like a spy

22
00:01:20.003 --> 00:01:22.960
earpiece. "Come in, Robot. Can you hear me?"

23
00:01:22.961 --> 00:01:25.989
Robot beeped.

24
00:01:25.990 --> 00:01:29.891
"Are you ready for our secret mission?" Hope said.

25
00:01:29.892 --> 00:01:32.201
Robot beeped again.

26
00:01:32.202 --> 00:01:36.563
Hope darted over and picked Robot up.

27
00:01:36.564 --> 00:01:47.529
They sneaked down the stairs.

28
00:01:47.530 --> 00:01:50.351
Hope peeked into the kitchen.

29
00:01:50.352 --> 00:01:53.533
Henry was there doing homework.

30
00:01:53.534 --> 00:01:55.930
Hope tapped her hearing aid again.

31
00:01:55.931 --> 00:01:59.834
"Target located," she whispered.

32
00:01:59.835 --> 00:02:05.551
Hope and Robot sneaked into the kitchen.

33
00:02:05.552 --> 00:02:08.914
She tiptoed past Henry.

34
00:02:08.915 --> 00:02:13.194
Henry pretended not to notice her.

35
00:02:13.195 --> 00:02:15.243
Then he looked up.

36
00:02:15.244 --> 00:02:18.735
"Hope, what are you doing?"

37
00:02:18.736 --> 00:02:22.743
Hope giggled and ran away.

38
00:02:22.744 --> 00:02:25.887
Robot liked hearing Hope's laugh.

39
00:02:25.888 --> 00:02:38.026
She held him as she went upstairs.

40
00:02:38.027 --> 00:02:43.605
"You're the best, Robot!" she said.

41
00:02:43.606 --> 00:02:47.047
"This is so much fun!" Robot thought.

42
00:02:47.048 --> 00:02:49.652
His lights glowed yellow again.

43
00:02:49.653 --> 00:02:54.248
"Horse said toys could make a child happy," he thought.

44
00:02:54.249 --> 00:02:59.872
"Was this what he was talking about?"

